# Saved Review result storage and history. This is not the job backend or prompt target default.
# Named Review, Debugger and Eval Builder targets resolve Copilot Studio Kit - Dev when no environment is supplied.
# Review jobs use the existing job/job-item tables and Review Agent Components processor in exact-name Copilot Studio Kit - Dev.
# Job reads, uploads, queueing, status and resume use that same backend; saved results remain in the configured home.
# Eval Builder uses caller-scoped target access; it has no separate privileged application-user setting.
AGENT_KIT_HOME_ENVIRONMENT_ID=
